# Handle Mid-term Cancellations and Refund Requests

Apollo provides a subscription-based service with contracts. Some customer requests mid-term cancellations. Apollo's Terms of Service don't allow mid-term cancellations, but support must carefully review and handle each request for exceptions.
<hr>
## Special Conditions
<a name="sc"></a>
<p>Escalate cases for exception handling if they involve:</p>
<ul><li>Threats of legal action (e.g. customer threatens to sue Apollo).</li>
<li>Alleged contract breach by Apollo.</li>
<li>Reputational risk (e.g. BBB complaint, public escalation).</li></ul>
<p>Fraud or abuse concerns may also require escalation:</p>
<ul><li>Suspicious usage patterns.</li>
    <li>Multiple refund requests.</li>
    <li>Evidence of account abuse.</li></ul>
## Automatic Denial Scenarios
<p>Early termination and refunds are automatically denied if the request is due to:</p>
<ul><li>Budget constraints.</li>
<li>Internal reorganization.</li>
<li>Company bankruptcy or closure.</li>
<li>General complaints about unified credits migration, unless tied to a special condition (see above).</li></ul><br>
<b>Macro Available: Downgrade or Cancel Mid-Cycle - Custom</b>
<hr>
## Process
<ol><li><b>Check for <a href="#sc">Special Conditions</a></b><br>
If present, gather:
- Customer's full legal name and entity type.
- Current ARR.
- Link to the latest valid Order form.
- Usage data since renewal.
- Payment method.
- Supporting evidence (screenshots, logs, documentation).
- Communication history. Include support, pushback, and customer responses.
Escalate to Legal via <a href="https://apollopde.atlassian.net/servicedesk/customer/portal/85/user/login?destination=portal%2F85%2Fgroup%2F405%2Fcreate%2F641">Legal Team Service Desk (JIRA)</a><br>
<b>Macro Available: Midterm Cancellation: Special Condition</b>.
<li><b>Determine Sales Ownership</b></li>
- If sales owns the account, escalate to <a href="https://apolloio.slack.com/archives/C02JV4RBKMM">#sales-team-support</a> with sufficient context and tag the sales owner.<br>
<b>Macro Available: Midterm Cancellation: Sales Owned</b>.
<p class="warning--message">Follow up in the thread until the sales owner engages in the customer conversation.</p></li>
<li><b>No Special Condition</b></li>
- If no special condition is involved, escalate to the <a href="https://apolloikb.zendesk.com/hc/en-us/articles/39671482574221-How-to-Escalate-to-Different-Teams">Billing Advocates Team</a>.</ol>
