## Billing Advocates
### Early Termination Requests
<p class="note--message">If a customer requests cancellation more than 30 days before renewal, loop in the sales owner in the conversation and notify the owner in <a href="https://apolloio.slack.com/archives/C02JV4RBKMM">#sales-team-support</a></p>.
