    - Approve support tot ake ownership of the customer or;<br>
    - Take over the conversation.
    </li>
    <li>If legal review is needed, escalate to Legal in <a href="https://apolloio.slack.com/archives/C03R6CVPPUY">#gtm-customer-contracting</a>. Include the following:<br>
    - Teams.<br>
    - Signer's first and last name.<br>
    - Signer's email address.<br>
    - Full legal name of the company, including entity identifier (e.g. Inc., LLC, GmbH, etc.)<br>
    - Link to the last order form that was not an upsell.<br>
    - Context
